IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SCAN-DEMO-PROG.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT SCAN-LOG ASSIGN TO 'scan_report.txt'.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 SCAN-STATUS PIC X(20) VALUE "SCANNING...".
01 DETECTED-SECRET PIC X(32) VALUE "AI_AGENT_KEY_998877665544332211".
01 REPORT-LINE PIC X(80).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "LANCEMENT DU SCAN DE SECURITE...".
    DISPLAY "RECHERCHE DE PATTERNS DANS LE CODE SOURCE...".
    IF DETECTED-SECRET NOT = SPACES
        DISPLAY "ALERTE : SECRET TROUVE : " DETECTED-SECRET
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "AUCUN SECRET DETECTE."
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY "FIN DU PROCESSUS.".
    STOP RUN.